Alembic migration environment (task P1-DB-2).

Run from the repository root:

    python -m alembic -c backend/alembic.ini upgrade head      # make migrate
    python -m alembic -c backend/alembic.ini downgrade base     # make migrate-down
    python -m alembic -c backend/alembic.ini revision -m "..."  # make migrate-revision m="..."

Target database: backend.db.migration_url() — the Neon direct/unpooled DSN from
the server-side .env (DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED, task P1-DB-1), or an
ALEMBIC_DATABASE_URL override.

The real schema starts at P1-DB-3 (portfolio_snapshots); revision
0001_baseline carries no DDL.
